5,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,Let's start by being honest. We need a logical way to find the werewolf. I suggest we watch for any contradictions in how people describe their roles.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Sakura,,"Yay, a mystery! Maybe the werewolf is someone who looks way too serious? Like, maybe they're hiding a big scary face behind a frown!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Toshio,,Emotional outbursts aren't reliable indicators. We should focus on who is trying too hard to lead and who is staying too quiet.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,I agree with the need for calm. I will simply observe and listen to the arguments presented.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Kenji,,I'm with Mizuki! Let's all just be friends and help each other out. We can totally find the bad guy if we work together!,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Sakura, playfulness is fine, but don't let it distract us. @Toshio, do you have a specific method for observing these patterns?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Sakura,,"Aww, Mizuki is so strict! I'm just adding some flavor to the game. Maybe the werewolf is actually the most cheerful person here!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Toshio,,I'll be looking for inconsistencies between what people say now and how they vote tomorrow. That's where the truth usually hides.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,That seems like a sound approach. I'll keep a mental note of the claims made today.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Kenji,,I'll be the best observer ever! I'll make sure nobody feels left out while we hunt for the wolf.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,"If anyone claims to be the Seer, we should be cautious. A fake Seer is a common werewolf tactic to mislead the village.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Sakura,,"Ooh, a fake Seer! That sounds like a fun prank. I wonder who would be the best at lying?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Toshio,,"Exactly. We must verify any ""divinations"" against the actual outcomes of the nights.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,"I will follow the most logical path. If the evidence points to someone, I will support that conclusion.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Kenji,,I trust you guys! I'm sure we'll figure it out without any fighting.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Mizuki,,"Let's settle in for the first night then. Everyone, please think carefully about your interactions.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Sakura,,"Goodnight everyone! Sleep tight, and don't let the werewolf bite! Teehee!","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
