31,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"We have no deaths yet, as expected for day one. Now we must look for any slips of the tongue.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"Maybe the werewolf is just shy! @Kenji, you're being awfully quiet now. Are you hiding a fluffy tail?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"@Kenji, you were very eager to be ""helpful"" yesterday. Sometimes that's a mask for someone trying to blend in.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"It is early to draw conclusions, but Toshio's observation is noted.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"What?! @Sakura, that's not funny! And @Toshio, I'm just being friendly! Why are you guys picking on me?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Kenji, your reaction is quite strong. While it could be innocence, it could also be a defensive reflex.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Sakura,,Maybe he's just embarrassed! Or maybe he's thinking about who to eat tonight! Just kidding!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"I have a strong feeling about Kenji. The way he tries to maintain a ""perfect"" image is suspicious.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"If Toshio is confident, I am inclined to listen. He has been the most analytical so far.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Kenji,,I'm not masking anything! I really just want us to win! You're all making me sound like the bad guy!,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Toshio, are you claiming to have information, or is this just a hunch based on behavior?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Sakura,,Let's not be so mean to Kenji! Maybe we should vote for someone else just to see what happens?,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I don't need to reveal my role to tell you that Kenji's behavior is the most inconsistent with a simple villager.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,Sakura's suggestion to vote randomly is illogical. We should follow the evidence.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"See! Jonathan knows! Sakura is just playing around, but Toshio is actually trying to get me kicked out!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Sakura"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,"Sakura's attempt to divert the vote is actually more suspicious than Kenji's panic. However, Toshio's focus on Kenji is persistent.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Kenji"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Sakura,,Hey! I'm just being a kid! Don't be mean to me too!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Toshio,,The diversion is a classic tactic. But the target remains Kenji.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I will vote based on the strongest suspicion. Toshio seems the most certain.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Kenji,,"Please, I'm a villager! Don't listen to them!","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
